#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:2
msgid "Curse of the Mummy"
msgstr "De Mumie ehr Flöök"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:3
msgid ""
"Drawing on Western movie icons about mummies and Egypt, this set of levels is best run under the Treasure of Egypt theme.\n"
"\n"
"To polish your Egyptology, you will find factual tidbits related to each level in the hints, where the facts are drawn from Wikipedia rather than Hollywood.\n"
"\n"
"This Championship game was composed by Steve Mann <smann at cgl uwaterloo ca>, with a few Egyptian ideas and the Red Sea level contributed by Ian Wadham."
msgstr ""
"Disse Sett vun Speelstopen speelt in't ole Ägypten un warrt op't Best mit dat Muster \"De Schatt vun Ägypten\" speelt.\n"
"\n"
"Binnen de Henwiesen för de enkelten Stopen gifft dat lütte Bontjes mit de ägyptoloogschen Fakten. De kaamt ut de Wikipedia, nich ut Hollywood.\n"
"\n"
"Dat Baasspeel hett Steve Mann <smann at cgl uwaterloo ca> tosamenstellt, mit en poor ägyptschen Ideen un de Stoop \"Dat rode Meer\" , de Ian Wadham bidragen hett."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:10
msgid "The Giza Plateau"
msgstr "De Plateau vun Gizeh"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:11
msgid ""
"The Giza Plateau on the outskirts of Cairo is the site of the Giza Necropolis, which consists of the Pyramid of Khufu (The Great Pyramid), the Pyramid of Khafre, the Pyramid of Menkaure, along with the Great Sphinx and a number of other smaller edifices.\n"
"\n"
"As you make your way under the plateau, try to avoid killing the mummies: if too many reappear on the right, it becomes difficult to escape at the end.  To get started, you will need to use the technique of digging while falling."
msgstr ""
"Op't Plateau vun Gizah an den Rand vun Kairo liggt de Dodenstadt vun Gizeh. Se ümfaat de Pyramiden vun Chufu (de grote oder Cheops-Pyramied), Chafre (Chephren) un Menkaure (Mykerinos) blang de grote Sphinx un en Reeg anner Buuwarken.\n"
"\n"
"Wenn Du nerrn dat Plateau langs geihst, maak de Mumien man nich doot. Wenn to vele rechterhand opdukt, warrt dat Utneihen an't Enn swoor. För den Anfang muttst Du dat al könen, dat Du bi't Fallen graavst."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:16
msgid "The Pyramid of Djoser"
msgstr "Djoser sien Pyramied"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:17
msgid ""
"The Pyramid of Djoser (Zoser), or step pyramid (kbhw-ntrw in Egyptian) is an archeological remain in the Saqqara necropolis, Egypt, northwest of the city of Memphis.\n"
"\n"
"To complete this level, it is important to proceed in steps: first free the mummy on the left side of the second level (from the bottom), allowing it to drop into and fill the hidden pit on the ground level.\n"
"\n"
"Now enter the right side of the second level and move across the pole, over the mummy, and get the piece of treasure in the middle, being sure to dig out the brick to the left of the middle.\n"
"\n"
"The mummy on the third level is a bit problematic because it will take a piece of treasure and carry it.  You may get lucky and find that it abandons its treasure at some point, but you can also trap him in the one diggable brick on the right with careful timing.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, before getting the last piece of treasure, be sure to open the bottom right of the step pyramid to allow the mummies on the right to enter the pyramid - if there is more than one mummy on the bottom right before the escape ladder appears, you will be unable to reach the exit."
msgstr ""
"De Pyramied vun Djoser oder ok »Stopenpyramied« is en archäoloogsch Buuwark binnen de Dodenstadt Sakkara in Ägypten, noordwesten de Stadt Memphis.\n"
"\n"
"Du muttst in Stopen vörgahn, wenn Du disse Stoop afsluten wullt: Toeerst de Mumie linkerhand de twete Stoop (vun nerrn) freelaten, so dat se na't versteken Lock in den Bodden daalfallt un dat füllt.\n"
"\n"
"Gah denn na de rechte Siet vun de twete Stoop, över den Pahl un de Mumie, na den Schattdeel in de Merrn. Links de Merrn muttst Du den Tegel weggraven.\n"
"\n"
"De Mumie op de drütte Stoop maakt Problemen, se griept sik en Deel vun den Schatt un löppt dor mit weg. Du magst Glück hebben un se lett den Deel wedder loos, man Du kannst ok den enkelten Tegel rechterhand weggraven un ehr dor fastsetten, wenn Du nau op de Tiet kiekst.\n"
"\n"
"Oplest, ehr Du den lesten Deel vun den Schatt haalst, muttst Du de Stopenpyramied nerrn rechts opmaken, so dat de Mumien rechterhand rinkamen köönt - is dor mehr as een Mumie nerrn rechts na, ehr de Utneih-Ledder opdukt, kannst Du dor nich henkamen."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:28
msgid "Pharaoh's Barge"
msgstr "Den Pharao sien Bark"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:29
msgid ""
"The Khufu ship is an intact full-size vessel from Ancient Egypt that was sealed into a pit in the Giza pyramid complex at the foot of the Great Pyramid of Giza around 2,500 BC. The ship was almost certainly built for Khufu (King Cheops).\n"
"\n"
"It is one of the oldest, largest, and best-preserved vessels from antiquity, and measures 43.6 m overall.  Despite its age, it could sail today if put into water.\n"
"\n"
"This is almost a simple level: good treasure and not too many mummies.  But your task is to wrest the treasure they carry."
msgstr ""
"Dat Chufu-Schipp is en heel, groot Bark ut dat ole Ägypten. Se hebbt dat 2500 v.Chr. in en Kuhl bi de Pyramiden vun Gizeh inslaten, blang de grote Pyramied. Dat is meist seker, se hebbt dat Schipp för Chufu (Pharao Cheops) buut.\n"
"\n"
"Sien hele Längde is 43,6 Meters, un dat is een vun de öllsten, gröttsten un op't Best wohrten Waterfohrtüüch ut de Antike. Liekers kunn dat ok vundaag fohren, wenn Een dat to Water bringen dee.\n"
"\n"
"Disse Stoop is meist eenfach: En groot Schatt un nich to vele Mumien. Du muttst se den Schatt bloots afnehmen."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:36
msgid "Pyramid Puzzles"
msgstr "Pyramied-Radel"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:37
msgid ""
"The Great Pyramid was the tallest man-made structure in the world for over 3,800 years.  Going up and down all the time must have been a chore for ancient Egyptians, much as you are likely to find it a chore going up and down this pyramid.\n"
"\n"
"To get the second treasure from the left, you have to use the brick that blocks the ladder at the bottom as a bridge to escape.\n"
"\n"
"To get the fourth treasure from the left, clear the three brick above and to the right of the left most mummy; if dug in the correct order, this will give you just enough time to grab the treasure and escape.\n"
"\n"
"Some of the mummies must be released to get some of the treasure.  However, get the first, second, and fourth treasures (from the left) before releasing any of the mummies.  Be careful not to kill any mummies; if they appear to the right of the pyramid, you will be unable to finish the level.  Also it is possible to release the mummies and trap them in one of the other chambers."
msgstr ""
"De grote Pyramied weer för mehr as 3.800 Johr dat gröttste vun Minschen maakte Buuwark. Dat Rop- un Daalgahn mutt för de olen Ägypters en Möög wesen hebben, jüst as för Di bi disse Pyramied.\n"
"\n"
"Wullt Du den tweten Schattdeel vun links halen, muttst Du bi't Utneihen den Tegel, de de Ledder nerrn blockeert, as Brüch bruken.\n"
"\n"
"Wullt Du den veerten Schattdeel vun links halen, maak de dree Tegels baven un rechts vun de heel linke Mumie weg, maakst Du dat in de richtige Reeg, hest Du jüst noog Tiet, dat Du den Schatt griepen un utneihen kannst.\n"
"\n"
"Du muttst en poor Mumien freelaten, wenn Du den helen Schatt kriegen wullt. Man haal Di toeerst den eersten, tweten un veerten Deel (tellt vun links), ehr Du een freelettst. Maak keen Mumien doot, wenn se rechterhand de Pyramied opdukt, kannst Du de Speelstoop nich afsluten. Du kannst aver Mumien freelaten un binnen en anner Kamer fastsetten."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:46
msgid "Crocodile"
msgstr "Krokodil"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:47
msgid ""
"Crocodiles can live to be over 100 years of age, with the largest species reaching 4.85 meters in length.  Various species have been observed attacking and killing sharks.\n"
"\n"
"Sobek was the deification of crocodiles.  Egyptians who worked or travelled on the Nile hoped that if they prayed to Sobek, the crocodile god, he would protect them from being attacked by crocodiles.\n"
"\n"
"In this level, it is not the crocodile you need to fear.  Still, a prayer to Sobek might help you escape the mummies while you gather the treasure."
msgstr ""
"Krokodilen köönt mehr as 100 Johr oolt warrn, un de gröttste Oort warrt 4,85 Meters lang. En Reeg Krokodiloorden griept ok Haien an un maakt se doot.\n"
"\n"
"Sobek weer de Krokodilgott. Ägypters, de op den Nil arbeiden oder fohren, hebbt to Sobek baden, dat he se vör Krokodilangreep schulen schull.\n"
"\n"
"In disse Stoop bruukst Du nich vör Krokodilangreep bang wesen. Man liekers mag Di dat Beden to Sobek hölpen, dat Du de Mumien utneihen kannst, bides Du de Schattdelen insammelst."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:54
msgid "Three Pyramids"
msgstr "Dree Pyramiden"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:55
msgid ""
"The Giza Necropolis has been a popular tourist destination since antiquity, and was popularized in Hellenistic times when the Great Pyramid was listed by Antipater of Sidon as one of the Seven Wonders of the World. Today it is the only one of those wonders still in existence.\n"
"\n"
"You may find it easiest to navigate this wonder if you get two mummies in the far right pyramid before going over there."
msgstr ""
"De Dodenstadt vun Gizeh is vun de Antike an en geern anstüert Teel för Touristen wesen. In de Grekentiet hett Antipater vun Sidon de grote Pyramied mit sien Optellen vun de söven Weltwunnern överall begäng maakt. Vundaag is vun disse söven Wunnern bloots se noch na.\n"
"\n"
"Dat Lopen dör dit Wunner is wull op't Eenfachst, wenn Du twee Mumien in de Pyramied heel rechts kriggst, ehr Du dor hengeihst."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:60
msgid "Tura Caves"
msgstr "De Tura-Löcker"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:61
msgid ""
"Tura was Egypt's primary quarry for limestone, and was used on the Great Pyramid of Khufu.  The mining of this limestone left behind caverns that were later used by the British Army as a secret depot during World War II, and which you can now explore.\n"
"\n"
"To the left of the bottom of the long shaft, there are two hidden pits.  Free the mummy to the right of the long shaft to fill one of them and free the mummy in the large chamber to fill the other.  Be sure to ride the first of the two mummies down to get the piece of treasure in the nook near the bottom of the shaft.  When leaving this nook, dig to your right several times to open up your escape route.\n"
"\n"
"Get all the treasure on the left of the board, then move to the right.  Make sure to dig free the mummy at the top so that you can get its treasure later.  You will also need its help to escape back to the left at the end of the level.  The treasure on the right is easier to get than it looks: strategically placed false bricks make this the easy half of the level.  Note: If you feel like some variety, you can do all of the right first and then the left."
msgstr ""
"Ut Tura keem in Ägypten de beste Kalksteen. Se hebbt em blang annern ok för de grote Cheops-Pyramied bruukt. De britische Armee hett de Löcker un Höhlen vun't Utgraven later in den 2. Weltoorloog as en versteken Depot bruukt, un nu kannst Du se ankieken.\n"
"\n"
"Links vun den langen Schacht sien Grund gifft dat twee versteken Löcker. Mit de Mumie rechterhand den langen Schacht kannst Du dat ene un mit de ut de grote Kamer dat annere opfüllen. Bring de eerste vun de twee Mumien daal, wenn Du den Schattdeel binnen dat Huuk blang den Schachtgrund insammeln wullt. Kaamst Du ut dit Huuk, graav en poormaal na rechts ut maak Di den Weg för't Utneihen free.\n"
"\n"
"Haal Di all de Schattdelen op de linke Siet, denn gah na rechts. Beseker dor bi, Du lettst de Mumie baven free, denn kannst Du ehr Schattdeel later insammeln. Du bruukst ehr ok bi't Utneihen an't Enn vun de Speelstoop. De Schattdeel rechterhand lett sik lichter insammeln, as dat utsüht: Mit Plaan verdeelt leeg Tegels maakt dit to de eenfache Halfpart vun de Speelstoop. Wenn Di na en beten Afwesseln is, kannst Du ok toeerst de rechte un denn eerst de linke Halfpart maken."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:68
msgid "Pyramid Crawl"
msgstr "Pyramiden-Krupen"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:69
msgid ""
"There are over 100 pyramids in Egypt, with the oldest being built around 2600 BC.\n"
"\n"
"In this pyramid level (built around AD 2008), avoid (by luring away or killing) getting the two mummies in the middle of the bottom section."
msgstr ""
"Dat gifft mehr as 100 Pyramiden in Ägypten, de öllste wöör so üm 2.600 v.Chr. buut.\n"
"\n"
"Binnen disse Stoop (buut so üm Anno Domini 2008) muttst Du de twee Mumien nich na de Merrn vun den Afsnitt nerrn kamen laten, lock se dor weg oder maak se doot."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:74
msgid "The Great Sphinx"
msgstr "De grote Sphinx"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:75
msgid ""
"The Great Sphinx is a guardian of the Giza Plateau, where it faces the rising sun.  Standing 73 meters long and 20 meters high, it is the largest monolith statue in the world and is a mere 4500 years young.\n"
"\n"
"As you grab the treasure inside the sphinx, try to solve The Riddle of the Sphinx: how do you get past the horde of mummies on the right?"
msgstr ""
"De grote Sphinx is en Wachtersche vun de Hoochevene vun Gizeh. Se kiekt de opgahn Sünn an, is 73 Meters lang un 20 Meters hooch. Se is dat gröttste tosamanhangen Standbild op de Welt un bloots 4500 Johren jung.\n"
"\n"
"Wenn Du den Schatt binnen de Spinx funnen hest, versöök, wat Du de Sphinx ehr Radel lösen kannst: Wodennig kannst Du de Rott vun Mumien rechterhand vörbi kamen?"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:80
msgid "Ladder Pyramid"
msgstr "Ledderpyramied"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:81
msgid ""
"Most accepted theories on the construction of the pyramids are based on the idea that it was built by moving huge stones from a quarry and dragging and lifting them into place. The disagreements center on the method by which the stones were conveyed and placed.  Regardless, there were likely many ladders involved in its construction, such as on this level.\n"
"\n"
"This level is mostly a run around.  Picking up the treasure while avoiding mummies is not so hard - but getting treasure away from the mummies is a much harder task.  The three-wide stone platform is a useful killing field, although you'll have to run around a bit to get the mummies carrying treasure to line up properly.  Note also that the middle block of this platform is a fall-through block.\n"
"\n"
"And once you've gotten all the treasure, you'll need to cross over to the escape ladder.  One way to do this is to kill a mummy and cross over on its back when the mummy crosses from the escape ladder to the main pyramid."
msgstr ""
"De mehrsten Theorien över den Buu vun de Pyramiden buut op de Idee, dat de olen Ägypters grote Steen ut en Steenbrook rantrocken un na ehr Steden böört hebbt. Verscheel gifft dat över de Metood, de se dor för bruukt hebbt. Liekerveel, se mussen dor wull vele Leddern bi bruken, so as binnen disse Speelstoop.\n"
"\n"
"In disse Stoop muttst Du veel lopen. Dat Insammeln vun Schattdelen un sik nich vun Mumien kriegen laten is nich so swoor. Swoor is, Du muttst de Delen vun de Mumien wegbringen. De Plaat ut dree Steen lett sik goot as Dootmaak-Steed bruken, man Du muttst en beten rümlopen, ehr Du de Mumien, de en Deel dreegt, in en propper Reeg hest. Wichtig is, Een fallt dör den Block in de Merrn vun de Plaat dör.\n"
"\n"
"Hest Du eerstmaal all Delen, muttst Du röver na de Utneih-Ledder kamen. Een Metood dorför is, Du maakst en Mumie doot un löppst över ehr hen, wenn de Mumie vun de Utneih-Ledder na de Hööftpyramied löppt."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:88
msgid "Ankh"
msgstr "Anch"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:89
msgid ""
"The Ankh was the Egyptian hieroglyphic symbol that read 'life', and as a sun symbol, was almost always crafted in gold.\n"
"\n"
"To keep your life on this level, be careful of the false bricks in the main Ankh and figure out which of them are useful."
msgstr ""
"\"Anch\" weer dat ägyptsche Schriftteken för \"Leven\", un, as Sünnteken, tomehrst ut Gold maakt.\n"
"\n"
"Wenn Du disse Stoop överleven wullt, pass op de legen Tegels binnen dat \"Anch\" op un finn de rut, de sik dor vun bruken laat."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:94 gamedata/game_plwv.txt:53
msgid "Pharaoh's Tomb"
msgstr "Den Pharao sien Graff"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:95
msgid ""
"Researchers estimate that 2.3 million blocks were used to build the Great Pyramid, with an average weight of about 2.5 metric tons per block.\n"
"\n"
"The pyramid of this level was built from fewer than 100 blocks.  In the beginning, manuever to get inside the pyramid and then stand on one of the ladders on the second layer nearest the outer wall of the left side of the pyramid.  Wait for the mummies to group on the other side of the outer wall.  Then climb to the top of the ladders on the small pyramid and wait for the mummies to climb the tall ladder and drop off the pole.  Once the last one has dropped (or slightly before), run up the tall ladder, across the pole and dig to get back inside the big pyramid and to the tomb.\n"
"\n"
"Repeat this trick to exit after grabbing the lone piece of treasure, only this time you need to get out on the right side of the pyramid."
msgstr ""
"De Wetenschapers estemeert, dat för de grote Pyramied 2,3 Millionen Blöck nödig weren, mit en Dörnittgewicht vun 2,5t per Block.\n"
"\n"
"De Pyramied in disse Stoop besteiht ut weniger as 100 Blöck. An'n Anfang muttst Du Di na de Pyramied rinmanövreren un Di op een vun de Leddern op de twete Laag stellen, blang de Butenwand vun de Pyramied ehr linke Siet. Tööv, dat sik de Mumien op de anner Siet vun de Butenwand tohoopfinnen doot. Denn klatter na't böverste Enn vun de Leddern op de lütte Pyramied un tööv, dat de Mumien de grote Ledder ropklattert un vun den Pahl daalfallt. Is de leste daalfullen (oder en beten vördem), loop de grote Ledder hooch, över den Pahl un graav, so dat Du torüch rinkummst na de Pyramied un dat Graff.\n"
"\n"
"Hest Du den enkelten Schattdeel insammelt, wedderhaal dissen Trick, man ditmaal muttst Du op de rechte Siet vun de Pyramied rut."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:102
msgid "Cat"
msgstr "Katt"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:103
msgid ""
"A revered, important animal to Egyptian society and religion, the cat was afforded the same mummification after death as humans were.\n"
"\n"
"When finishing this catty level, do not be fooled by the cat's tail that appears once you pick up the last treasure.  The only exit is on the left.  So you need to let the mummies bring you the treasure that is to the right of the cat's head, since you cannot pick up every piece and run back in time.\n"
"\n"
"To get the mummies to bring you the treasure, you must dig out the five bricks on the bottom and allow them to pass (or get trapped and killed). "
msgstr ""
"En verehrt, wichtig Deert in de ägyptsche Sellschap un ehr Gloven. Katten wöörn jüst so as Minschen na den Dood to Mumien maakt.\n"
"\n"
"Sluttst Du disse kattenfründliche Stoop af, laat Di nich vun de Katt ehr Steert verdummdüveln. He dukt op, wenn Du den lesten Deel vun den Schatt opnimmst. Rut geiht dat bloots linkerhand. Du muttst Di also den Deel rechts den Kattenkopp vun de Mumien bringen laten, Du kannst nich all Delen binnen de geven Tiet insammeln un wedder utneihen.\n"
"\n"
"Wullt Du Di den Deel vun de Mumien bringen laten, muttst Du de fief Tegels nerrn weggraven un de Mumien vörbilaten (oder infangen un dootmaken)."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:110
msgid "Pyramid Power"
msgstr "Pyramidenstärk"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:111
msgid ""
"Imhotep designed the Step Pyramid of Djoser to serve as a gigantic stairway by which the soul of the deceased pharaoh could ascend to the heavens.  Such was the importance of Imhotep's achievement that he was deified by later Egyptians.\n"
"\n"
"Before you can ascend to the top of this pyramid level, you must make your way to the bottom.  To get the top piece of treasure, move left off the apex, dig the next block and step onto the mummy below, continuing to move right (try placing your mouse pointer on the apex).\n"
"\n"
"After getting the last piece of treasure, exit to the right and run up and down the ladders.  The lower left is the only difficult part: just run under the mummies on the ladder above you and maneuver ... and hope!"
msgstr ""
"Imhotep hett Djoser sien Stopenpyramied as resig Stieg utleggt, över de den Doden sien Seel na den Heven opstiegen kunn. Sien Leisten weer för de achterankamen Ägypters so wichtig, dat se em later as en Gott verehren.\n"
"\n"
"Ehr Du rop na den Tipp vun disse Pyramiden-Stoop kannst, muttst Du eerst na nerrn finnen. Wenn Du den Deel baven kriegen wullt, gah vun den Tipp na links, graav den nakamen Block weg, pedd op de Mumie nerrn dorvun un gah wieder na rechts (versöök dat un wies mit de Muus op den Tipp). \n"
"\n"
"Hest Du den lesten Deel vun den Schatt insammelt, gah na rechts rut un loop de Leddern rop un daal. Dat Rebeet links nerrn is swoor: loop eenfach nerrn de Mumien op de Ledder över Di un un haap ... un wriggel Di dör!"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:118
msgid "Eye of Horus"
msgstr "Horus sien Oog"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:119
msgid ""
"The Eye of Horus is an ancient Egyptian symbol of protection and royal power from deities.\n"
"\n"
"On this level, there is some protection inside the eye, but not much.  Repeated trips from the top to the bottom are required to get all the treasure.  Eventually, there will be two mummies on the bottom left.  To get by them, climb to the top of the short ladder four from the left, dig left, climb down and dig left again.  One of the mummies will fall in the lower pit.  Climb up the ladder.  The second mummy will climb the other ladder and fall in the top pit.  Move across the two trapped mummies and climb to the top."
msgstr ""
"Horus sien Oog is en oolt ägyptsch Symbool för Schuul un königlich Stärk vun de Gödder.\n"
"\n"
"In disse Stoop gifft dat wat Schuul binnen dat Oog, man nich veel. Du muttst wedder un wedder vun baven na nerrn lopen, wenn Du den helen Schatt insammeln wullt. Amenn blievt nerrn twee Mumien na. Wenn Du de vörbikamen wullt, klatter de korte Ledder veer vun links rop, graav na links, klatter daal un graav nochmaal na links. Een vun de Mumien fallt in't Lock nerrn. Klatter de Ledder rop. De twete Mumie klattert denn de annere Ledder rop un fallt na't annere Lock rin. Loop över de twee fastsett Mumien un klatter na baven."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:124
msgid "Inverted Pyramid"
msgstr "Ümdreiht Pyramied"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:125
msgid ""
"Probably not a traditional Egyptian design.\n"
"\n"
"You have to zig-zag back and forth along the poles to get all the treasure.  To get past the lone chaser mummy, wait for him on one pole and just before he reaches you, drop to the pole below and move directly under him.\n"
"\n"
"Since the design is non-traditional, considering playing the level non-traditionally: the drop-and-move-under move is easier to do with the keyboard (easier, but still hard).  Once you get the last piece of treasure above the bricks inside the pyramid, pause the game and switch back to mouse mode."
msgstr ""
"Wull keen redig ägyptsch Opbuu.\n"
"\n"
"Du muttst langs de Pöhl vör- un torüchlopen, wenn Du den helen Schatt insammeln wullt. Wullt Du de enkelte Jagermumie vörbikamen, tööv op een Pahl, dat se kummt, un jüst, ehr se bi Di anlangt, lettst Du Di op den Pahl nerrn Di fallen un geihst direktemang ünner de Mumie.\n"
"\n"
"As de Opbuu nich traditschonell is, muttst Du ok nich-traditschonell spelen: Disse Fallen-un-dor-ünner-gahn-Tog lett sik eenfacher mit de Tastatuur maken (eenfacher, man liekers swoor). Hest Du den lesten Deel baven de Tegels binnen de Pyramied, holl dat Speel an un wessel wedder na de Muusstüern."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:132
msgid "Anubis"
msgstr "Anubis"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:133
msgid ""
"Anubis, or Inpu, was an Egyptian god of the afterlife.\n"
"\n"
"To get the treasure between Anubis' ears, dig out the two columns to the left of the mummy and stand on top of the mummy.  Move left off the mummy while digging right.  The mummy should fall into the hole in the right most column.  Now dig out the left two columns until you connect to the ladder-eye.  Move down from the right most ladder of the eye and you will fall to the pole below.\n"
"\n"
"To get the treasure inside the right ear, dig out the higher of the two-block columns, falling onto the right two-block column.  Move to the left and dig the second two-block column.  Now move to the right and dig out the one-block column, freeing the mummy.  Move one more to the right and dig out three blocks so that you have a two block wide ledge to stand on.  Move left and dig out the square to your right.  Wait for the mummy to fall, get his treasure, and race up the ladder to confront five mummies blocking the exit."
msgstr ""
"Anubis, oder Inpu, weer en ägyptsch Gott vun't Dodenriek.\n"
"\n"
"Wenn Du den Schattdeel twischen Anubis sien Ohren halen wullt, graav de twee Sülen links de Mumie ut un stell Di op ehr rop. Gah na links vun ehr weg, bides Du na rechts graven deist. De Mumie schull na't Lock in de rechte Süül rinfallen. Graav nu de twee linken Sülen ut, so dat Du bi't Ledderoog ankummst.  Gah vun sien rechte Ledder na nerrn un laat Di op den Pahl nerrn dor vun fallen.\n"
"\n"
"Wenn Du den Deel binnen dat rechte Ohr hebben wullt, graav de högere vun de Twee-Blöck-Sülen ut un fall daal op de rechte Twee-Blöck-Süül. Gah na links un graav bi de twete Twee-Blöck-Süül. Gah nu na rechts un graav de Een-Block-Süül ut, wat de Mumie freesett. Gah noch een na rechts un graav dree Blöck ut, so dat en Kant mit de Breed vun twee Blöck nablifft, op de Du stahn kannst. Gah na links un graav dat Veereck rechts vun Du ut. Tööv, dat de Mumie daalfallt, sammel sien Schattdeel in un birs de Ledder rop na de fief Mumien, de den Utstieg blockeert."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:140
msgid "Pyramid of Treasure"
msgstr "Schattpyramied"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:141
msgid ""
"Nubia was a major source of gold in Egypt.  King Tushratta of the Mitanni claimed gold was 'more plentiful than dirt' in Egypt.\n"
"\n"
"In this pyramid, treasure is even in the air!  Lots of treasure, only three mummies - it can't be that hard, can it?"
msgstr ""
"Nubien weer för Ägypten en groot Born för Gold. König Tuschratta vun Mitanni sä, dat geev \"mehr Gold as Schiet\" in Ägypten.\n"
"\n"
"Binnen disse Pyramied gifft dat sogor Schattdelen in de Luft! Vele Delen, bloots dree Mumien - kann doch gor nich so swoor wesen, oder wat?"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:146
msgid "Sarcophagus"
msgstr "Sarkophaag"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:147
msgid ""
"A sarcophagus is a funeral receptacle for a corpse, most commonly carved or cut from stone.  In Ancient Egypt, a sarcophagus formed the external layer of protection for a royal mummy, with several layers of coffins nested within, and was often carved out of alabaster.\n"
"\n"
"If you do not want this level to be your sarcophagus, get the piece of treasure under the left edge of the sarcophagus at the start - otherwise, there is no way to get it."
msgstr ""
"En Sarkophaag is en Gräffnisgelaats för en Doden, tomehrst ut Steen uthöhlt oder sneden. In't ole Ägypten weer de Sarkophaag de Butenlaag vun en königlich Mumie ehr Schuul. Dor binnen geev dat en Reeg Sargen binnenenanner. De Sarkophaag weer faken ut Rabalster maakt.\n"
"\n"
"Wenn Du dat nich wullt, disse Stoop schall Dien Sarkophaag warrn, haal Di toeerst den Schattdeel nerrn de linke Kant vun den Sarkophaag - anners gifft dat keen Mööglichkeit, dor an to kamen."

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:152
msgid "The Parting of the Red Sea"
msgstr "Dat Delen vun't rode Meer"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_CM.txt:153
msgid ""
"The Bible tells us that Moses parted the sea to escape the Pharaoh's men.  After you have looted the pyramids of his ancestors, it should come as no surprise that the Pharaoh has sent his men after you, too.\n"
"\n"
"Fortunately, the sea can be parted just by falling onto the last treasure.  To escape the Pharaoh's men is not so easy.  First, make your hero go down as far as he can, then wait for his moment.   Then move up the wall of water to the right, cross the pole to the middle and wait for the mummies to reach the top of the water before dropping down a second time.\n"
"\n"
"This time, immediately run up the wall of water to your left, crossing under the chasing mummies.  Await near the top left where the mummies to your right cannot get you.  Once the mummies to your left reach the top, drop to the sea bed a third time (even Moses did not have it this rough).  The trick to getting past the mummies on this last trip to the top is to pass under and to the left of them while they are falling as a column down one of the long ladder drops.\n"
"\n"
"Note: It is possible to move up the wall of water to your left initially, but it is much harder."
msgstr ""
"De Bibel vertellt, Moses hett dat rode Meer deelt, so dat he vör den Pharao sien Lüüd utneihen kunn. Na dat Du de Pyramiden vun sien Vörvaders plünnert hest, is dat wull keen Beloop, wenn sien Lüüd ok Di achterankaamt.\n"
"\n"
"Wat'n Glück, dat sik dat Meer deelt, wenn Du Di op den lesten Schattdeel fallen lettst. Vör den Pharao sien Lüüd utneihen is nich so eenfach. Toeerst muttst Du so wiet daal gahn, as Du kannst, un op Dien Tiet töven. Denn gah de Waterwand rechterhand hooch, över den Pahl na de Merrn un tööv, dat de Mumien bi den Tipp vun't Water anlangt, ehr Du Di en tweet Maal fallen lettst.\n"
"\n"
"Ditmaal muttst Du fuurts de Waterwand links hooch un nerrn de jachtern Mumien dörlopen. Tööv blang den Tipp links, woneem de Mumien rechterhand Di nich rut köönt. Kaamt de Mumien links vun Di bi den Tipp an, laat Di wedder na den Grund daalfallen. De Trick, wodennig Du de Mumien ditmaal vörbikummst: Loop nerrn un links de Mumien langs, bides se as en Striep vun en vun de langen Leddern daalfallt\n"
"\n"
"Beacht: Du kannst ok toeerst de Waterwand links hoochgahn, man dat is veel sworer."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:2
msgid "Count"
msgstr "Tellen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:3
msgid ""
"This game is based on counting, from 0 to 16 (or 0 to 10 in hexadecimal).  The first level has no gold and no enemies: the problem is to find a way out and up to the next level.  After that, the number of enemies and pieces of gold increases by 1 at each level.  The name of each level corresponds to the number of enemies, the pieces of gold and the digits that appear in the layout.\n"
"\n"
"These elegant and rather tricky Championship levels were composed by Steve Mann <smann at cgl uwaterloo ca>."
msgstr ""
"Dit Speel is op't Tellen opbuut, vun 0 to 16 (oder, hexadezimaal, vun 0 to 10). Binnen de eerste Stoop gifft dat keen Gold un keen Feenden: Dat Problem is dat, Du muttst en weg rut un hooch na de nakamen Stoop finnen. Achteran stiegt de Tall vun Goldklümp un Feenden mit elkeen Stoop üm 1. De Stopen ehr Naams hangt mit de Tall vun Feenden, vun Goldklümp un mit de Tallen in't Speel tosamen.\n"
"\n"
"Disse eleganten un recht vigelienschen Wettstriet-Stopen hett Steve Mann <smann at cgl uwaterloo ca> opstellt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:8
msgid "Zero"
msgstr "Null"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:9
msgid ""
"The only challenge is getting inside the 0, which is the only path to the exit.\n"
"\n"
"Getting inside the 0 requires climbing to the top of the zigzag ladder, digging away five bricks on the left edge of the 0, racing back to the top of the zigzag ladder, over the pole, falling through your recently dug bricks and immediately moving right to get into the 0.  The timing is fairly tight."
msgstr ""
"Du muttst bloots na de 0 rinkamen, dat is alleen de Weg na buten.\n"
"\n"
"Dor muttst Du de Zickzack-Ledder för ropklattern, fief Tegels op de 0 ehr linke Kant weggraven, wedder de Ledder rop- un denn över den Pahl birsen, Di dör de weggraven Tegels fallenlaten un fuurts na rechts gahn. Du hest dor nich veel Tiet för."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:14
msgid "One"
msgstr "Een"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:15
msgid ""
"Getting the gold requires multiple digs in the right places.  However, see the next paragraph.\n"
"\n"
"To get out, you have to get the enemy to go over the top of the 1 and fill the pit at the bottom.  There are three ways to do this.  The first and most sensible is to wait on the pole above the top right edge of the 1 until the enemy is almost upon you and then move to the right, digging to your right as you reach the bottom of the 1.\n"
"\n"
"The second way involves timing your digging for the gold (or where the gold was); moving onto the gold at the right time will cause the enemy to fall into the pit on the right of the 1.  The third way is to destroy the enemy and hope he reappears over the right side of the 1."
msgstr ""
"Wullt Du an't Gold, muttst Du an de richtigen Steden graven. Man, lees maal wieder:\n"
"\n"
"Wullt Du rut, muttst Du den Feend baven över de 1 locken, so dat he dat Lock nerrn opfüllt. Dat kannst Du op dree Oorden maken: De eerste un villicht beste is, Du töövst op den Pahl baven de 1 ehr Kant rechts baven, bet dat de Feend meist bi Di is - denn geihst Du na rechts un graavst na rechts, wenn Du bi den Grund vun de 1 ankummst.\n"
"\n"
"Bi de twete Oort muttst Du jüst to de rechte Tiet na't Gold graven (oder dor, woneem dat weer). Geihst Du to de rechte Tiet op den Goldklümp, fallt de Feend rechterhand de 1 in't Lock. Bi de drüdde Oort maakst Du den Feend doot un haapst, he kummt över de rechte Siet vun de 1 wedder."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:22
msgid "Two"
msgstr "Twee"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:23
msgid "To get the leftmost gold drop down on it from above, stepping one square to either side as you fall.  Immediately dig the square that was just below the gold and step in.  The false floor will drop you to the bottom."
msgstr "Wenn Du den linken Goldklümp hebben wullt, laat Di op em daalfallen un gah dor een Steen wiet bi to elk Siet. Graav fuurts dat Feld nerrn den Goldklümp weg un gah dor rin. De lege Tegel lett Di denn na nerrn dör."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:26
msgid "Three"
msgstr "Dree"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:27
msgid "After getting all the gold, the only escape is up the highest ladder on the left, but it is not connected to anything.  To reach it, you will need to entice an enemy to follow you, then step across the enemy to reach the ladder."
msgstr "Na't Insammeln vun all Goldklümp kannst Du bloots över de hööchste Ledder links utneihen, man de föhrt narms hen. Wullt Du dor ankamen, muttst Du en Feend achter Di ran locken un denn över em hen na de Ledder gahn."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:30
msgid "Four"
msgstr "Veer"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:31
msgid ""
"At the start, you need to race to the floor to the right.  You will need to trap some enemies (with luck, you will get a piece of gold in the process), but you should easily be able to go up the ladders shaped like a 4, on the right. \n"
"\n"
"When getting the gold from the 4, wait until the enemies have reached the top of the ladders shaped like a 4.  This will allow you enough time to reach the ladders before the enemies cut you off."
msgstr ""
"Du muttst toeerst na den Bodden rechts birsen. Du muttst en Reeg Feenden fastsetten (mit en beten Glück kriggst Du dor en Goldklümp bi), man dat Ropklattern op de Leddern, de rechts en 4 formt, is nich so swoor.\n"
"\n"
"Bi't Halen vun't Gold vun de 4, tööv bet de Feenden baven op de Ledder-4 ankamen sünd. Dit gifft Di noog Tiet un de Feenden köönt Di den Weg na de 4 nich afsnieden."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:36
msgid "Five"
msgstr "Fief"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:37
msgid "In the beginning, climb down the first set of ladders and wait on the lowest section until the enemies have settled in their positions.  Then drop to the floor and aim for the big ladder at the the right with the fork at the bottom.  The fork is what enables you to get past the enemies above: wait at the floor level of the left rung (not below the floor level!) until the enemy on the long ladder drops next to you.  Then climb up and to the right to get up the big ladder."
msgstr "Klatter toeerst den eersten Ledder-Sett daal un tööv op den Afsnitt nerrn, dat de Feenden an ehr Steden to Roh kaamt. Denn lettst Du Di op den Grund daalfallen un loop na de grote Ledder rechts mit de Tweel nerrn. Mit disse Tweel kannst Du de Feenden baven vörbikamen: Tööv op Grundhööchde (nich nerrn dorvun!), dat de Feend op de lange Ledder blang Di daalfallt. Denn klatter hooch, na rechts un denn de grote Ledder rop."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:40
msgid "Six"
msgstr "Söss"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:41
msgid ""
"The first trick for this level is to time when you go through the bottom of the 6 with the enemy climbing up the ladder to the left of the 6.  Once you get on the ladder, the enemies will climb up the ladder away from you, so you just need to wait until there are no enemies low on the ladder before digging through the bottom of the 6.\n"
"\n"
"The second trick is figuring how to get all the enemies off the ladder on the left of the screen.  One way is to sit on top of the big 6 in the middle and wait for them to come over the poles.  Then drop to the floor and cross to the ladder."
msgstr ""
"De eerste Trick för disse Stoop is, Du muttst de Tiet afpassen, wannehr Du nerrn dör de 6 geihst, bides de Feend de Ledder links de 6 ropklattert. Kummst Du bi de Ledder an, klattert de Feenden de Ledder rop, weg vun Di. Du muttst denn bloots töven, dat dor keen Feenden siet op de Ledder sünd, ehr Du Di dör den Grund vun de 6 graven deist.\n"
"\n"
"De twete Trick is, dat Du rutfinnen muttst, wodennig Du all de Feenden vun de Ledder links op den Schirm wegkriggst. Een Metood is, Du töövst baven op de 6 in de Merrn, dat se över de Pöhl kaamt. Denn lettst Du Di fallen un löppst na de Ledder."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:46
msgid "Seven"
msgstr "Söven"

#. +> trunk
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:47
msgid "The gold on top of the 7 is the main challenge.  In the beginning, climb to the left most square of the top of the 7 and wait there until enemies fill the holes on top of the 7."
msgstr "Dat Gold baven op de 7 is dat swoorste. Toeerst muttst Du baven op de 7 heel na links gahn un dor op töven, dat Feenden binnen de Löcker baven op de 7 fastsitten doot."

#. +> stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:47
msgid "The gold on top of the 7 is the main challenge.  In the beginning, climb to the left most square of the top of of the 7 and wait there until enemies fill the holes on top of the 7."
msgstr "Dat Gold baven op de 7 is dat swoorste. Toeerst muttst Du baven op de 7 heel na links gahn un dor op töven, dat Feenden binnen de Löcker baven op de 7 fastsitten doot."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:50
msgid "Eight"
msgstr "Acht"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:51
msgid ""
"With careful moves and timing, you can tempt two enemies over to the leftmost ladder and leave them there while you retrieve the five highest gold pieces.\n"
"\n"
"The three lowest pieces must be collected all in one pass, but you may need to force enemies towards the right of the 8 first, to avoid trouble when the ladders appear and you land on the floor.\n"
"\n"
"You can clear your final escape ladder by hitting the floor again, on the far right."
msgstr ""
"Mit suutje Bewegen un gode Tiet kannst Du twee Feenden na de Ledder heel links locken, se schöölt dör blieven, bides Du de fief hööchsten Goldklümp insammelst.\n"
"\n"
"De dree sietsten Klümp muttst Du all op eenmaal insammeln, man villicht muttst Du eerst Feenden na de 8 ehr rechte Siet drieven, anners gifft dat Arger, wenn de Leddern opdukt un Du op den Grund lannen deist.\n"
"\n"
"Du kannst de Utneih-Ledder leddig kriegen, wenn Du Di wiet rechts op den Grund daalfallen lettst."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:58
msgid "Nine"
msgstr "Negen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:59
msgid ""
"In the beginning, drop as fast as you can to get to the floor.  Dig several pits on the bottom to delay the enemies from coming up the ladder.  Then grab the two pieces of gold off the left side of the 9 while there are no enemies around, digging to enter the 9 after grabbing the higher of these two pieces.\n"
"\n"
"To get the gold from the bottom of the 9, stand on the left enemy, dig left and move right.  The two enemies will start to move left, fall, and climb the ladder.  When the first one gets stuck where you just dug, jump in the lowest part of the 9 and dig to the left.  The next enemy will carry the gold down.  Grab it, dig to the right, drop down to the pole and escape as quickly as you can."
msgstr ""
"Toeerst muttst Du Di so gau as't man bloots geiht na den Grund daalfallen laten. Graav dor en poor Löcker, dat höllt de Feenden op ehr Weg de Ledder hooch wat op. Griep Di de twee Goldklümp op de 9 ehr linke Siet, bides dor keen Feenden sünd. Na't Insammeln vun't högere vun de twee Klümp graavst Du Di na de 9 rin.\n"
"\n"
"Wullt Du dat Gold nerrn in de 9 halen, sett Di op den linken Feend, graav links un gah na rechts. De twee Feenden gaht na links, fallt daal un klattert de Ledder rop. Wenn de eerste dor fastsitt, woneem Du jüst graven hest, jump daal na de 9 ehr sietsten Deel un graav links. De nakamen Feend bringt dat Gold daal. Griep Di dat, graav rechterhand, laat Di op den Pahl fallen un neih ut, so gau as Du kannst."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:64
msgid "Ten"
msgstr "Teihn"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:65
msgid "You can trap several enemies in the pits at the bottom left and right, but they will get loose when the hidden ladders appear.  Dropping to the floor during your escape can help clear your path to the top right."
msgstr "Du kannst en Reeg Feenden in de Löcker nerrn rechts un links fastsetten, man se kaamt free, wenn de versteken Leddern opdukt. Lettst Du Di bi't Utneihen na den Grund daalfallen, mag dat wat dor bi hölpen, dat de Weg na baven rechts free warrt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:68
msgid "Eleven"
msgstr "Ölven"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:69
msgid ""
"Get the piece of gold below the left side of the poles shaped like an 11 first, then grab the piece on the base of the left 1 of the central 11.  Now drop to the floor just to the left of the double high wall.  The enemies will drop into different sections.  You now want to do three things: get the gold in the left and center sections, take gold from the enemies to the right of you when on the floor and lure as many enemies as you can into the section to the left of the 11.\n"
"\n"
"The first two tasks are relatively easy: the last task can be accomplished in several ways.  If you run up the center ladder and move over the left, you can wait above the right hand side of the poles (possibly dropping onto the poles) and lure a few enemies at a time from the center section to the left section.  You can also pick up a piece of gold or two while doing this.\n"
"\n"
"Once you have all the gold (except the pieces to the right of the 11), run to the top right of the H of ladders in the middle.  This will cause all the enemies not in the far right section to move into the left section."
msgstr ""
"Haal toeerst den Goldklümp op de linke Siet vun de Pöhl, de as en 11 utseht, denn griep Di den Klümp nerrn op de linke 1 vun de 11 in de Merrn. Laat Di jüst links vun de dubbelte hoge Muer daalfallen na den Grund, de Feenden fallt na anner Afsneed daal. Nu muttst Du dree Saken maken: dat Gold ut den linken Afsnitt un ut den in Merrn halen, de Feenden rechts vun Di dat Gold afnehmen, wenn se op den Grund sünd, un so vele Feenden as mööglich na den Afsnitt links vun de 11 locken.\n"
"\n"
"De eersten twee Opgaven sünd recht licht, de leste lett sik op verscheden Oorden doon. Klatterst Du de Ledder in de Merrn rop un geihst na links, kannst Du baven de Pöhl ehr rechte Siet töven oder Di dor op fallen laten un jümmers wedder en poor Feenden vun den Middelafsnitt na den linken locken. Dor kannst Du ok een, twee Goldklümp bi insammeln.\n"
"\n"
"Hest Du eerstmaal all Goldklümp (utbenahmen de rechterhand de 11), loop na baven rechts vun dat Ledder-H in de Merrn - denn kaamt all Feenden, de nich jüst heel rechts sünd, na den linken Afsnitt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:76
msgid "Twelve"
msgstr "Twölf"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:77
msgid ""
"This is a slow level with lots of waiting for enemies to move where you want them.\n"
"\n"
"At the start, fall onto the nearest enemy as it falls and move onto the right hand poles to get the piece of gold just below them.  Be sure to wait for an opening in the enemies below before dropping onto this gold piece. \n"
"\n"
"The grid of 12 boxes on the right is useful: if you are not on the top level, then the enemies climbing the ladder just left of the grid will not drop onto it.  You can use this to move them above the traps on the left, then drop to the floor to get them to fall into them.\n"
"\n"
"Another useful trick is to wait at the top of the ladder on the far left (where you start the level).  Any enemies far enough away will run over the top of the grid of boxes and drop into the trapped area on the right.  \n"
"\n"
"To get the gold on the leftmost floor area, you need to fill the second section of floor with enemies and dig out the squares that block the enemies in the leftmost region.  You may want to lose that gold (i.e. have the enemy carrying the gold enter a dug square and be destroyed there), although it is possible to get this piece of gold if you really want it.\n"
"\n"
"If you leave the leftmost suspended gold until last, then it is easy to escape to the top.  Alternatively, if you leave the gold inside the 2 for last, you should be able to escape without much difficultly.  Otherwise, the enemies trapped on the far left will cut off your escape route."
msgstr ""
"Bi disse Stoop muttst Du veel Tiet hebben un dor op töven, dat de Feenden dorhen gaht, wo Du se hebben wullt.\n"
"\n"
"Toeerst lettst Du Di op den neegsten Feend fallen, wenn he fallt, un geihst na rechts op de Pöhl rechterhand, denn kannst dat Gold nerrn dorvun insammeln. Beseker, dat gifft en Lück twischen den Feenden nerrn, ehr Du Di op den Goldklümp fallen lettst.\n"
"\n"
"Dat Gadder ut 12 Kastens rechts is för wat goot: büst Du nich heel baven, fallt de Feenden, de de Ledder links vun't Gadder ropklattert, dor nich rop. So kannst Du se över de Fallen links föhren.Lettst Du Di denn na den Grund daalfallen, fallt de Feenden in de Fallen.\n"
"\n"
"En anner Trick is, Du töövst baven op de Ledder heel links (woneem Du mit de Stoop anfangst). Feenden, de wiet noog weg sünd, loopt över dat Kastengadder un fallt rechts na't Fallenrebeet daal.\n"
"\n"
"Wullt Du dat Gold ut dat Grundrebeet links buten halen, muttst Du den tweten Grundafsnitt mit Feenden opfüllen un de Feller weggraven, de de Feenden links blockeren doot. Villicht wullt Du dat Gold ok lever wegkamen laten (a.B. wenn Du den Feend mit den Goldklümp na en weggraven Feld lockst un he dor to Dood kummt), ok wenn dat mööglich is, dat Du den Klümp kriggst, wenn Du dat redig wullt.\n"
"\n"
"Lettst Du den Goldklümp links buten bet tolest liggen, is dat Utneihen na baven eenfach. Du kannst ok dat Gold binnen de 2 bet tolest liggen laten, dor schullst Du ok noch ahn grötter Malöör weglopen könen. Versöchst Du anner Saken, kaamt Di de fastsett Feenden heel links licht in de Mööt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:90
msgid "Thirteen"
msgstr "Dörteihn"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:91
msgid ""
"In the beginning, wait on the top of the left (or better, right) branch of the leftmost ladders until the enemies in the middle climb to the middle of the center ladder.  Then drop to the horizontal ladder, move all the way to the right and drop to the floor, thus trapping several enemies.\n"
"\n"
"You have to release most of the enemies from where they are trapped, to get the gold from various places.  In particular, you have to release the enemies trapped on the left half of the floor to get at least one piece of gold.  \n"
"\n"
"Once you pick up the last piece of gold, the enemies will swarm the center ladder, so you will have to decide which piece of gold to pick up last.  A reasonable choice is the one held by the three enemies in the lowest leg of the 3, as is the one in the center arm of the 3."
msgstr ""
"Toeerst töövst Du baven op den linken (oder beter noch, den rechten) Telg vun de Leddern heel links, dat de Feenden in de Merrn na de Merrn vun de Middelledder ropklattert. Laat Di denn op de kimmrechte Ledder daalfallen, gah heel na rechts un laat Di na den Grund daalfallen, dor settst Du en Reeg Feenden bi fast.\n"
"\n"
"De mehrsten Feenden muttst Du ut ehr Fallen rutlaten, wenn Du all Goldklümp insammeln wullt. Tominnst för een Goldklümp muttst Du besünners de rutlaten, de op de linke Halfde vun den Grund fastsitten doot.\n"
"\n"
"Sammelst Du den lesten Goldklümp in, belagert de Feenden de Middelledder - Du muttst Di also den Goldklümp utsöken, de oplest överblieven schall. En goot Köör is de Klümp bi de dree Feenden binnen den sietsten Arm vun de 3 oder de binnen de 3 ehr Middelarm."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:98
msgid "Fourteen"
msgstr "Veerteihn"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:99
msgid ""
"Four tricks: first, do not dig out the enemies trapped in the 4s on the left until towards the end (likewise if one gets trapped in the middle 4) - this leaves fewer enemies to deal with. \n"
"\n"
"Second, you will need to ride down on top of an enemy to get the trapped gold in the 4s on the left and the floating piece of gold in the center.\n"
"\n"
"Third, when you release the enemies on the 4s along the right (and possibly the two in the 4s on the left), you may find it easier to double dig and lose those pieces of gold.\n"
"\n"
"Finally, it is easiest to escape at the end if you leave until last a piece of gold in or near the floating 14 at middle right.  Then you can run up the ladder that appears there."
msgstr ""
"Veer Tricks: toeerst, graav de Feenden, de links binnen de Veren fastsitten doot, nich ut, ehr dat nich op't Enn togeiht (gellt ok, wenn Een binnen de Middel-4 fastsett warrt) - denn blievt weniger Feenden över, mit de Een sik afquälen mutt.\n"
"\n"
"De Twete: Du muttst baven op en Feend sitten un daalfallen, wenn Du den fastsett Goldklümp binnen de Veren linkerhand un den swewn Goldklümp in de Merrn insammeln wullt.\n"
"\n"
"De Drüdde: Lettst Du de Feenden op de Veren rechts (un villicht ok de twee binnen de Veren links) loos, is dat villicht eenfacher, Du graavst dubbelt un lettst disse Goldklümp wegkamen.\n"
"\n"
"Oplest: Dat Utneihen geiht op't Eenfachste, wenn Du en Goldklümp binnen oder dicht bi de sweven 14 rechterhand bet tolest överlettst - denn kannst Du de Ledder ropbirsen, de dor opdukt."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:108
msgid "Fifteen"
msgstr "Föffteihn"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:109
msgid ""
"Two hints: if you wait on one of the left two ladders one rung below the piece of gold suspended between the two ladders, the enemies in the middle will jump into the base of the 5.  This should allow you to easily get the gold between the 1 and the 5.\n"
"\n"
"Second, if you wait on the base of the 1 to the right of the one, the enemies on the right of the two ladders to the left of the 1 will jump off the pole onto the other half of the base of the 1.  If you wait high up between the 1 and the 5, then jump to the base of the 1, while the enemies are falling toward the base of the 1 you will be able to rush up the ladder to the left of the 1 and get the gold to the left of the 1."
msgstr ""
"Twee Tipps:Töövst Du op een vun de twee Leddern een Stoop nerrn den Klümp, de twischen de Leddern hangt, jumpt de Feenden in de Merrn na den Nedderdeel vun de 5. So kannst Du eenfach an de Klümp twischen de 1 un de 5 ankamen.\n"
"\n"
"De Twete: Töövst Du nerrn bi de 1 rechts dorvun, jumpt de Feenden rechts vun de Ledder links vun de 1 vun de Pöhl daal op de annere Halfde vun de 1 ehr Basis. Töövst Du hooch baven twischen de 1 un de 5, jump daal na de 1 ehr Basis. Bides de Feenden dorhen daalfallt, kannst Du de Ledder ropbirsen un Di dat Gold links de 1 griepen."

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:114
msgid "Sixteen"
msgstr "Sössteihn"

#. +> trunk stable
#: gamedata/game_cnt.txt:115
msgid ""
"The column to the left of the 1 requires a quick run down and back up, with careful dodging both ways to avoid the enemies.\n"
"\n"
"To get the gold in the middle of the 6, drop down on the top of the 'O' part of the 6, move right/dig left and immediately move left and dig left to delay the enemy who otherwise is likely to catch you.  However, you may wish to leave this piece of gold to the end so as not to free two additional enemies earlier; it is possible to get two enemies to retrap themselves in that section, though.\n"
"\n"
"To get the gold held by enemies in the bottom right, dig out the blocking square to their left, run up the ladder, dig off the right side of the 6, drop in, run left and dig off a square on the left side of the 6 and drop to the floor.  The timing is tight - only one or two enemies in the bottom right section will be able to move to the next section to the left.  You will still need to dig out the bottom of the 6 to get their gold, but that is straightforward albeit a bit hectic because of the enemies lingering to the left of the 6.\n"
"\n"
"Once you have gotten all the gold, you may find it easiest to exit by passing through the middle false floor on the 1 and exiting via the ladders on the left of the 1."
msgstr ""
"För den Striep links vun de 1 muttst Du gau daal- un wedder roplopen un dor de Feenden bi achtsam ut den Weg gahn.\n"
"\n"
"Wullt Du an dat Gold in de 6 ehr Merrn kamen, laat Di baven op den O-Deel vun de 6 daalfallen, gah na rechts oder graav links un gah fuurts na links un graav links, dat höllt den Feend op, de Di anners wull kriegen wöör. Man laat dissen Klümp man bet tolest över, sünst lettst Du twee anner Feenden free, ok wenn Du se dorto bringen kannst, dat se sik sülven binnen den Afsnitt wedder fastsett.\n"
"\n"
"Wullt Du dat Gold bi de Feenden nerrn rechts halen, graav dat Feld op ehr linke siet weg, birs de Ledder rop, graav de 6 ehr rechte Siet weg, laat Di dor rinfallen, loop na links, graav dor en Feld vun de linke Siet weg un laat Di na den Grund daalfallen. Du hest nich veel Tiet - bloots een oder twee Feenden binnen den Afsnitt nerrn rechts kaamt na den Afsnitt links dor blang. Du muttst liekers noch den Bodden vun de 6 weggraven, wenn Du ehr Gold hebben wullt, man dat is liekut, wenn ok en beten fickerig, links vun de 6 luurt noch Feenden.\n"
"\n"
"Hest Du all dat Gold kregen, is dat villicht op't Eenfachste Du neihst dör den legen Bodden op de 1 ut un bruukst de Leddern links vun de 1."

#. i18n:
#. NOTES: Files 'gamedata/game_*.txt' are KGoldrunner DATA files.  They
#. are installed in $KDEDIR/share/apps/kgoldrunner/system and contain
#. names and descriptions of games, plus names and hints for levels.  You
#. may sometimes need to look at the corresponding game or level graphics
#. to work out a good translation (e.g. Initiation 25, Mongolian Horde).
#.
#. To see any level of any game, run KGoldrunner, click on the New Game button
#. and select the game and level from the list.  If you start to play a level,
#. you will probably need to stop the animation by pressing the Pause key
#. (default Esc or P).
#.
#. The most urgent translations would be names and hints for the Tutorial
#. games, then the game names and descriptions (as appearing in the main
#. dialog box) and then the other level names and finally the remaining
#. hints, which are intended for experienced players and champions.
#.
#. Messages marked as NOTi18n should deliberately be left untranslated. The
#. one below is never displayed and others, from time to time, would be long
#. hint texts used by a small number of championship players, left untranslated
#. to economise on translation effort.
#.
#. The "Das Boot" message in level 97 of the Initiation game is the name of
#. a German submarine warfare movie, left untranslated as a compliment to the
#. original author of KGoldrunner, who is German.  The movie is known as
#. "Das Boot" in many countries, including English-speaking countries.  If it
#. is known by some other name in your country, please include that in your
#. translation of the corresponding hint text.  See this Internet page:
#. http://akas.imdb.com/title/tt0082096/releaseinfo#akas
#.
#. +> trunk stable
